  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South East Sulaweshi Transmigration Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an integrated rural development project.  It consists of irrigation and drainage development, road improvement, construction of new transmigration settlements, improvement of existing transmigration settlements and villages, improvement of agricultural supporting services including research extension, livestock diseases control, marketing, processing and storage and studies for the development of the region.</narrative>
  </description>
